{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的感受词有时堆叠、重复或过于抽象，交替排布也会削弱长线阅读的连贯性，X在整体叙述上更自然顺畅。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成短句，并用【】高亮每段的关键心理变化，普通观众扫一眼更容易抓住要点；分时出现的感受词也能贴着音乐的变化逐步呈现，情绪细节更丰富。X的完整因果句和双栏结构更容易让人理解人物为什么这样想、前后为什么这样变化，但部分心理转折和音乐细节被压缩了。综合边听边看的实际体验，我选Y，不过它的感受词还需要进一步筛选，避免细腻变成堆砌。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b590f079-df7b-4a6b-9169-7b9cee2d9b0e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T213925495603Z", "elapsed_seconds": 188.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:42:33.607761+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "41f6e43ac3887c701cfc6f86dd7c34ec8c34cd3abd0b0afefe8ccd1019b13139", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py